### Health
GET http://localhost:3000/api/health

### Create reminder through chatbot endpoint
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "919876543210",
  "message": "Remind me tomorrow at 8 PM to complete my physics assignment"
}

### List reminders
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "919876543210",
  "message": "What are my reminders?"
}

### Cancel reminder
POST http://localhost:3000/api/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "919876543210",
  "message": "Cancel reminder REM-ABC123"
}
